### Boltz data pipeline

- Tokenization: [tokenize](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/tokenize/) with `BoltzTokenizer`.
- Featurization: [feature/featurizer.py](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/feature/featurizer.py).
- Cropping: [crop](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/crop/).
- Filters: [filter/static](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/filter/static/) and [filter/dynamic](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/filter/dynamic/).
- Parsing: FASTA/A3M/CSV/YAML under [parse](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/parse/).
- Writers: PDB/mmCIF in [write](mdc:src/simplefold/boltz_data_pipeline/write/).

### Utilities used in inference/training

- Inference batching and postprocess: [processor/protein_processor.py](mdc:src/simplefold/processor/protein_processor.py).
- FASTA helpers: [utils/fasta_utils.py](mdc:src/simplefold/utils/fasta_utils.py).
- Structure save utilities: [utils/boltz_utils.py](mdc:src/simplefold/utils/boltz_utils.py).
- mmCIF processing script: [process_mmcif.py](mdc:src/simplefold/process_mmcif.py).

